// Lyric lines (Section 12.6). Whitespace is always trimmed from lyric text and
// from each cell, so the two lines below are equivalent.
title "Lyric Cells"
key G

section Verse
| G | G7 | C | G |
> A-ma-zing | grace, how | sweet the | sound |
>A-ma-zing|grace, how|sweet the|sound
| G | Em | D |
> that saved | | me
// the empty second cell above is an unsung measure (no // comments on lyric lines)
> free text lyric, one string for the measure line above
